        <p>The bay still says Hole-in-the-Day. Crow Wing is a state park where a village used to stand. Madden's is still a family peninsula. Cragun's still says Gull Lake on the sign. BIR still shakes the pines in August. Every winter the Jaycees still ask the ice if it will hold.</p>
